    <div class="t3card"><h4>Documents you’ll need</h4><ul class="trl t3el">${BID_DOCS.map(([k, t]) => ck(docs.includes(k) ? true : false, esc(t) + (docs.includes(k) ? '' : k === 'safe' ? ' · <a href="#policies-safeguarding">template</a>' : k === 'eq' ? ' · <a href="#policies-equality">template</a>' : k === 'dp' ? ' · <a href="#policies-dataprotection">template</a>' : ''))).join('')}</ul><p class="note">The wrong bank statement is one of the most common reasons bids are held up: it must be in the organisation’s name and match the name on the form.</p></div>
