  <div class="t3card"><h4>Why we don’t post for you</h4><p class="note">The hub doesn’t log in to your accounts or post automatically. Posting tools need full access to your pages, and Meta only allows that for apps it has reviewed. Keeping your passwords and pages in your own hands is safer. Instead, plan here, then schedule the posts for free in Meta Business Suite (Facebook and Instagram), or post from your phone on the day with the reminder.</p><div class="row">${ext('https://business.facebook.com/', 'Meta Business Suite')}<a class="btn s sm" href="#brief">Get a campaign kit designed</a></div></div>
